### Vendored browser libraries
# Restored by npm run build:web, see docs/third-party.md
web/vendor/*
# The terminal kernel is built from the Ghostty sources instead of taken from
# a package, so it stays in the repository.
!web/vendor/ghostty/
# The fixed icon font ships with the client and needs no build-time download.
!web/vendor/nerd-fonts/

